### login request to retieve a token using API GATEWAY

POST http://localhost:8084/auth/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token) %}


### login request to retieve a token using Auth Service

POST http://localhost:8084/auth/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token) %}